#: irkick.cpp:105
msgid ""
"A connection to the infrared system has been made. Remote controls may now "
"be available."
msgstr ""
"Estabeleceuse unha conexión co sistema de infravermellos. Os controis "
"remotos poderían estar agora dispoñíbeis."

#: irkick.cpp:118
msgid ""
"The infrared system has severed its connection. Remote controls are no "
"longer available."
msgstr ""
"O sistema de infravermellos perdeu a conexión. Os controis remotos non están "
"xa dispoñíbeis."

